        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8.3(b)(5) Adjustments for Company Service. As a part of each periodic retention index review, and immediately following completion of the distribution procedure set forth in 8.3(b)(4), the retention rating of certain employees will be adjusted in compliance with the following:",
